     Global:
         in_mipi_phy:  sensor connect to preisp
         out_mipi_phy: preisp connect to ap
         mipi_lane:    mipi lane
         bayer:        bayer pattern
      Resolution:
          w:      width of image data
          h:      height of image data
          mipi_clk: mipi clk
          line_length_pclk:
          frame_length_lines:
          mode: to distingulish same resolution
        Vc:
           w:  width of data
           h:  height of data
